  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Animator class manages skeletal animation playback for an entity, handling loading, state transitions, and pose calculation. It controls playback speed, looping, and crossfading between multiple AnimationClip instances. Core logic involves stepping time, sampling channels from both current and previous clips, and blending the resulting bone transformations onto the entity's descendants via Transform objects."
  },
